<title>USA: DAKA to announce &quot;strategic alternatives&quot;.</title>
<headline>DAKA to announce &quot;strategic alternatives&quot;.</headline>
<dateline>DANVERS, Mass 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>DAKA International Inc said Wednesday it was close to announcing a decision on &quot;strategic alternatives&quot; that it has been considering.</p>
<p>&quot;The company has been exploring a number of strategic alternatives to improve performance and increase shareholders value,&quot; it said.  &quot;While no agreement has been reached with respect to any particular strategic alternative, the company expects to be in a position to announce specific initiative within the next few weeks.&quot;</p>
<p>It did not elaborate.</p>
<p>The company, which owns restaurants chains like Fuddruckers, reported a share loss of $0.11 for the third quarter against a loss of $0.56 after charges.</p>
